# Branch stacking

When prior feature PRs from this agent are still open and unmerged into `main`, do **not** start the next feature from `main` alone.

- Branch from or merge the latest open `cursor/*` feature branch so cumulative work stays in one tip.
- The latest PR must include earlier session improvements (filters, calculator, FAQ, etc.), not only the newest change.
- Before opening/updating a PR, verify key files from prior open PRs are present on the branch.
